    F. Czwielong (FAU Erlangen), S. Schoder (TU Graz), 'FAN 01 Benchmark: Low pressure Axial Fan in a short Duct', Zenodo,
    version v5, published 2026-05-05, doi:10.5281/zenodo.20037409 (creators, affiliations, title, date and licence from
    the record's metadata, version from the record page, read 2026-10-27; the record spells the first name Kroemer with
