NASA polynomial coefficients in source code, taken from Cantera (BSD 3-Clause)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
crates/rcfd-core/src/fluids.rs transcribes NASA seven-coefficient polynomial coefficients (McBride, Gordon and Reno, NASA
TM-4513, 1993) for the listed species from the Cantera distribution of that data set (data/nasa_gas.yaml), added to rcfd
on 2026-10-13; which Cantera release was used is not recorded. The header of data/nasa_gas.yaml (main branch, read
2026-10-27) names TM-4513 as "The original source" and the Caltech Shepherd thermo page as the download location, and
carries no licence or copyright statement of its own. The NASA Technical Reports Server record of TM-4513
(https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/19940013151, read 2026-10-27) lists the copyright determination
"GOV_PUBLIC_USE_PERMITTED", distribution "PUBLIC" and the flag belongsToUsGov false; two of its three authors are listed
without a NASA affiliation. Whether the coefficients are free of copyright everywhere is therefore not established here.
