graetz-parallel-plates, graetz-tube-eigenvalues, and the two parallel-plate rows of laminar-internal-flow-limits
  Files: validation-data/reference/graetz_parallel_plates.csv, graetz_tube_cwt_eigenvalues.csv, laminar_internal_flow_limits.csv
  Generator: validation-data/generate_graetz.py (finite-volume eigen-solve of the classical Graetz problem; needs numpy)
